@note +214 kind=intent confidence=0.95
why: Both commands failed with the same hand-written message, and that message
  told the reader to "Try --staged or --branch" even when they had just passed
  `--staged` — the one suggestion guaranteed to be useless. Routing both
  through one helper means the advice can be computed from the scope that
  actually failed.
