@note +276..282 kind=intent confidence=0.8
why: The split is on the first line that is exactly `---` because the template
  is markdown, where a horizontal rule is the natural boundary between
  "notes for the reader" and "the prompt itself". Falling back to the whole
  file keeps a template with no rule usable rather than emitting nothing.
